<title>USA: Oshkosh, Wis., $31.435 mln won by Raymond James.</title>
<headline>Oshkosh, Wis., $31.435 mln won by Raymond James.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Raymond James &amp; Assoc., Inc., said it won $31.435 million of Oshkosh, Wis., water revenue bond anticipation notes, Series 1997 C, with a true interest cost of 5.06028 percent.</p>
</text>
